<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-060" chapter-id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi" source-id="s-jinshu-060-sunqi-ws2413335">
  <p id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0000" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">孫旂</persName>，字伯旗，樂安人也。父<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0013" ref="muy_lgq_eek">曆</persName>，魏晉際為幽州刺史、右將軍。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0028" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>潔靜，少自修立。察孝廉，累遷黃門侍郎，出為荊州刺史，名位與二解相亞。永熙中，徵拜太子詹事，轉衛尉，坐武庫火，免官。歲餘，出為兗州刺史，遷平南將軍、假節。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0105" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0107" ref="y83_fx5_nct">弼</persName>及弟子<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0111" ref="bm1_n3w_kj9">髦</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0113" ref="ucg_nrt_zl8">輔</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0115" ref="iz1_7kc_rc7">琰</persName>四人，並有吏材，稱於當世，遂與<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0131" ref="8x5_e5i_yle">孫秀</persName>合族。及<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0137" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG">趙王倫</persName>起事，夜從<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0145" ref="8x5_e5i_yle">秀</persName>開神武門下觀閱器械。兄弟旬月相次為公府掾、尚書郎。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0171" ref="y83_fx5_nct">弼</persName>又為中堅將軍，領尚書左丞，轉為上將軍，領射聲校尉。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0197" ref="bm1_n3w_kj9">髦</persName>為武衛將軍，領太子詹事。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0210" ref="iz1_7kc_rc7">琰</persName>為武威將軍，領太子左率。皆賜爵開國郡侯。推崇<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0233" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>為車騎將軍、開府。初，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0245" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>以<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0247" ref="y83_fx5_nct">弼</persName>等受署偽朝，遣小息<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0257" ref="zcb_736_4vz">回</persName>責讓<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0260" ref="y83_fx5_nct">弼</persName>等，以過差之事，必為家禍。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0274" ref="y83_fx5_nct">弼</persName>等終不從，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0280" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>制之不可，但慟哭而已。及<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0293" ref="ee0_b2a_68e">齊王冏</persName>起義，四子皆伏誅。襄陽太守<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0309" ref="6mh_7dg_tpn">宗岱</persName>承<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0312" ref="ee0_b2a_68e">冏</persName>檄斬<persName id="c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0315" ref="b9n_ldy_9p3">旂</persName>，夷三族。</p>
</text>
